莊王爭彊，會諸侯于扈。陳畏楚，不會。晉使中行桓子伐陳，因救鄭，與楚戰，敗楚師。是年，成公卒，子景公據立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m093-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m093-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m093-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"中行桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"soh_mp7_j16","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m093-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m093-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"景公據","kind":"person","person_id":"4lj_xrf_bsl","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p095","text":"三年，楚莊王圍鄭，鄭告急晉。晉使荀林父將中軍，隨會將上軍，趙朔將下軍，郤克、欒書、先縠、韓厥、鞏朔佐之。六月，至河。聞楚已服鄭，鄭伯肉袒與盟而去，荀林父欲還。先縠曰：「凡來救鄭，不至不可，將率離心。」卒度河。楚已服鄭，欲飲馬于河爲名而去。楚與晉軍大戰。鄭新附楚，畏之，反助楚攻晉。晉軍敗，走河，爭度，船中人指甚衆。楚虜我將智罃。歸而林父曰：「臣爲督將，軍敗當誅，請死。」景公欲許之。隨會曰：「昔文公之與楚戰城濮，成王歸殺子玉，而文公乃喜。今楚已敗我師，又誅其將，是助楚殺仇也。」乃止。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"覆核更正：原連cbr-p000398楚成王；本提及是同句楚莊王的王，改連cbr-p000257。提及ID、字位及原文不變。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"荀林父","kind":"person","person_id":"soh_mp7_j16","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"wt0_abc_2sk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"趙朔","kind":"person","person_id":"7zv_9sd_gug","status":"contex